---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 61,
  title: 'Day 61',
  date: '2026-11-06',
  description: 'recrutation to raptors ',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <divh class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I had my first organic chemistry lessons, It was easier than I
          imagined it, We just made expriments, and its everything and we have
          to make essay about it in 4 people, It's really easy, after this I
          needed to find A7 building, luckily, with my electric bike it was
          really easy, and I was before the planned time, I think It went well,
          but meybe I'm wrong, I didn't known pythons libriearies, and what
          "CAN" is, but I don't think its neccesary at this stage, I think AI
          section is more complicated, and weird than I thought, so I'll try to
          go for ROS section, If I'll pass first stage I'll have project to make
          in this freamwork so I'll try to learn basics, or even more, after
          that I returned to dormitory ate something, I installed ROS2 becouse
          its the latest avaiable version of Ros
          <html lang="en">
            <head>
              <meta charset="utf-8" />
              <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
              <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
              <title>Document</title>
            </head>
            <body> </body>
          </html>
        </p>
      </section>
    </divh>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>I want to rest tommorrow</p>

      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          How I rate this day
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p>
            It's weak 4 I think, I installed Ros, I readed book, It sounds good,
            but It's not too much
          </p>
          <DayRating class="w-full" rating={4} />
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
